x750 text "A file starts with zero or more `use \"path.a0\"` lines, relative to the file. The linker loads every used file once, orders them by dependency, and validates the result as one program with one namespace. Cycles are rejected. A function name defined in two files is rejected with both locations. Diagnostics on a linked program name the file and line they belong to."
x751 puts x749 x750
x752 call close x751 
x753 call open x752 10
x754 write x753 4
x755 write x754 2
x756 text "code"
x757 puts x755 x756
x758 call open x757 4
x759 write x758 2
x760 text "use \"ui.a0\"\nuse \"../examples/life.a0\"\nfn page io -> io\na call open p0 5\nb call close a\nret b\nend"
x761 puts x759 x760
x762 call close x761 
x763 call close x762 
x764 call close x763 
x765 call open x764 13
x766 write x765 4
x767 write x766 1
x768 text "editing"
