x770 call open x769 11
x771 write x770 2
x772 text "Views and edits"
x773 puts x771 x772
x774 call close x773 
x775 call open x774 2
x776 write x775 2
x777 text "A model never sees a whole file. It asks for a view of one function: the function with a handle line on top (e0) and, when the whole program matters, a program handle (g0) with one signature line per function. A reply is the handle line followed by edits, one per line: `id op ...` replaces the instruction id or inserts it before ret; `id op ... @ other` inserts after other; `-id` deletes; `ret x` changes the result. Under g0, a whole `fn ... end` block adds or replaces a function and `-fn name` removes one. The edit is applied only if it parses, type-checks, validates, and was written against the current revision; otherwise it is rejected and the handle stays valid."
x778 puts x776 x777
x779 call close x778 
x780 call open x779 10
x781 write x780 4
x782 write x781 2
