x794 call close x793 
x795 write x794 2
x796 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x797 puts x795 x796
x798 call open x797 6
x799 write x798 4
x800 write x799 2
