x807 write x806 2
x808 text "e0\nhi lt p2 a\nr select hi p2 a"
x809 puts x807 x808
x810 call close x809 
x811 call close x810 
x812 call close x811 
x813 call open x812 13
x814 write x813 4
x815 write x814 1
x816 text "diagnostics"
x817 puts x815 x816
x818 call open x817 11
x819 write x818 2
x820 text "Diagnostics"
x821 puts x819 x820
x822 call close x821 
x823 call open x822 2
x824 write x823 2
x825 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x826 puts x824 x825
x827 call close x826 
x828 call close x827 
ret x828
end

