x838 puts x836 x837
x839 call close x838 
x840 call open x839 2
x841 write x840 2
x842 text "Static caps: 1024 functions, 4096 instructions per function, 64 parameters, arrays up to 65536 elements (1024 on the hardware and GPU targets), literal iteration budget 2^24 per function. The reference interpreter has fuel. io output is bounded by the caller's buffer. There is no heap, no recursion, no exceptions, and no undefined behavior: div and rem by zero are defined, shifts mask the count, indices wrap modulo the array length."
